---

<html lang="ja">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>日本サッカーWEBデータベース</title>
  </head>

  <body>
    <main>
      <div class="label">JAPANESE FOOTBALL ARCHIVE</div>

      <h1>日本サッカーWEBデータベース</h1>

      <p class="intro">
        日本サッカーの記録を、選手とクラブの歴史から辿る。
      </p>

      <section class="archive-section">
        <h2>年代から見る</h2>

        <div class="year-list">
          <a href="#">1960年代</a>
          <a href="#">1970年代</a>
          <a href="#">1980年代</a>
          <a href="#">1990年代</a>
          <a href="#">2000年代</a>
          <a href="#">2010年代</a>
          <a href="#">2020年代</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="archive-section">
        <h2>更新リスト</h2>

        <div class="current-list">
          <a href="/teams/toyota-90-91">
            <span class="season">90/91</span>
            <span class="team">トヨタ自動車</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(*) {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  :global(body) {
    margin: 0;
    background: #f4f5f3;
    color: #202522;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI",
      "Noto Sans JP", sans-serif;
  }

  main {
    width: min(1200px, calc(100% - 40px));
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 70px 0 90px;
  }

  .label {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: #68716b;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 48px);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .intro {
    margin: 0;
    color: #68716b;
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  .archive-section {
    margin-top: 55px;
    padding-top: 25px;
    border-top: 1px solid #cfd5d0;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    font-size: 20px;
  }

  .year-list {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 14px 18px;
  max-width: 820px;
}

  .year-list a {
    display: block;
    padding: 12px 18px;
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid #cfd5d0;
    color: #202522;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .year-list a:hover {
    background: #e7ebe8;
  }

  .current-list a {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
    width: fit-content;
    min-width: 280px;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid #cfd5d0;
    color: #202522;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .current-list a:hover {
    background: #e7ebe8;
  }

  .season {
    color: #68716b;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .team {
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    main {
      width: calc(100% - 24px);
      padding-top: 40px;
    }

    .year-list {
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .year-list a {
      padding: 10px 13px;
    }

    .current-list a {
      min-width: 0;
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>